{"title": "Note from Helsik", "pageid": 12181, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Note_from_Helsik", "categories": ["Notes", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Note_D_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Book_Note_D_Image.png/300px-Book_Note_D_Image.png.webp, /w/images/3/39/Book_Note_D_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Note from Helsik image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Book_Note_D_Image.png/300px-Book_Note_D_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Book_Note_D_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Note from Helsik</b> is a note from Helsik to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/38px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/50px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enver Gortash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Enver Gortash</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libe