lass=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Enver Gortash</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Lord G,\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Yes, if necessary, I could get you back into the House of Hope - for the right price, of course.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Though I doubt they'd be happy to see you again. You didn't exactly leave on the best of terms. However, you know your business better than I - or anyone else.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>H\n</p><p>Devil's Fee\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201547\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2107/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32155/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8177/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 937539/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.479      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   48.479      1 -total\n 65.33%   31.672      9 Template:Icon_text\n 58.17%   28.200     21 Template:Trim\n 34.49%   16.721      1 Template:PageSeo\n 34.44%   16.698      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 31.00%   15.030      3 Template:CharLink\n 29.41%   14.258      4 Template:Icon_link\n 20.71%   10.041      9 Template:Ifempty\n 20.01%    9.700      2 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12181-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201547 and revision id 365597. Rendering was triggere